                        "sense_id": "b0bc35b8-afb0-34c7-8478-b6cead3dedef",
                        "entry_id": "cc76b3ce-76bb-3bc8-a861-174805d881ab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any beetle of the family Dermestidae, most of which are scavengers that feed on dry animal or plant material."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddc80d7d-41ec-47c6-98b4-7c01f373d7de",
                                "sense_id": "b0bc35b8-afb0-34c7-8478-b6cead3dedef",
                                "text": "Stray dermestids are a great hazard in a biology department."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61631746-dc0e-486c-aa84-b78cdea3efee",
                                "sense_id": "b0bc35b8-afb0-34c7-8478-b6cead3dedef",
                                "text": "Some small dermestids are found in bee or wasp nests, where they feed on old pollen stores or on dried remains of bees or wasps."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9038dd2-3c9e-4177-a1d0-3d6b006540e0",
                                "sense_id": "b0bc35b8-afb0-34c7-8478-b6cead3dedef",
                                "text": "In nature, dermestids can be found on old, dry carcasses, in bird and mammal nests, while the adults of some species visit flowers, where they feed on pollen and nectar."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
